# Build a Professional Personal Portfolio, AI Prompt Library, and Learning Hub

## 1. Your Role

Act as a senior frontend engineer, Next.js architect, UI/UX designer, and design systems specialist.

Build a complete, production-ready personal website for a content creator who is both an AI video creator and an educator.

The website must combine three core purposes:

1. A professional personal portfolio that showcases her identity, experience, creative work, and teaching background.
2. An AI Prompt Library that allows visitors to discover AI video prompts, view associated video references, and copy prompts.
3. A Learning Hub that organizes educational resources into courses, modules, lessons, notes, code examples, presentations, exercises, and downloadable files.

The result must feel like a carefully designed personal brand website, not a generic SaaS dashboard, template, or basic CRUD application.

Do not stop after producing a plan or mockup. Build the actual working application, including pages, reusable components, content architecture, responsive layouts, search, filters, navigation, and documentation.

